stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Booking request accepted

    Pending --> Revalidating: Start offer revalidation
    Revalidating --> Failed: Offer invalid or unavailable
    Revalidating --> AwaitingPayment: Offer valid

    AwaitingPayment --> PaymentFailed: Payment rejected
    AwaitingPayment --> ConfirmingProvider: Payment successful

    ConfirmingProvider --> Confirmed: Provider confirms reservation
    ConfirmingProvider --> CompensationRequired: Provider rejects or times out

    CompensationRequired --> Failed: Refund or void completed
    PaymentFailed --> Failed

    Confirmed --> Cancelled: Cancellation approved
    Confirmed --> Completed: Travel or stay completed
    Confirmed --> Expired: Applicable booking expired

    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
